cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Consultation AI: a fully local, open-source AI consultation assistant"
abstract: >-
  A fully local, GDPR-conscious AI consultation assistant, developed by a
  practising clinician as an open research and education platform (not a
  medical device; synthetic consultations only). It performs live
  transcription, speaker diarisation, cited SOAP-note generation, live
  clinical decision support, and retrieval-grounded guideline summaries,
  running entirely on a single consumer GPU.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: "Herath Mudiyanselage Wajira Indika"
    family-names: "Herath"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0008-6367-1588"
repository-code: "https://github.com/IndyWH/consultation-ai"
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - clinical AI
  - ambient scribe
  - speech recognition
  - clinical decision support
  - retrieval-augmented generation
  - local-first
